{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721010/extras/SaveAnimalCardsLvlUpSpin.gif?t=1748677185\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Relax, Rescue, and Play \u2014 A Cozy Card Adventure Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Animal Hearts: A Card Quest</strong> is a charming and relaxing solo <strong>solitaire card game</strong> designed to help you chill and relax with pastel colors and pleasant music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo version, you\u2019ll play through the first island of the adventure, featuring hand-crafted levels where you rescue caged animal friends using light strategy and solitaire gameplay. This build includes several unique levels to play, a sample of the soothing soundtrack, and a sneak peek at the game\u2019s cozy visual style. Perfect for players who want to experience the peaceful world of Animal Hearts before the full release.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721010/extras/SaveAnimalSad1.gif?t=1748677185\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721010/extras/skeleton2.gif?t=1748677185\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721010/extras/SaveAnimalCardsLvlUp1.gif?t=1748677185\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721010/extras/SaveAnimalCardsSpin.gif?t=1748677185\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3721010?t=1748677185","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721010/c831a13ae6fba8a2cfe4e98b3ccd246451a00d85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748677185","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721010/73effea38d6199cbc581ab97c65bd14e50746